      "message": "Skia builds with C++17 and will continue to do so for some time. It may be interesting to also add a C++20 build to ensure we build with that as well, since C++20 introduces so many backwards incompatibilities. Skia is an actual library built by many users outside of Chromium where the default C++ version may not be C++17 or greater. Also, note that this is not really in any way related to the Chromium build of Skia, which is in \u003cchromium\u003e/src/skia/BUILD.gn.",
